    "short_description": "Prison Puzzle is a single-player escape game set in a mysterious prison. Solve intricate puzzles to find the only way out. With an engaging storyline, challenging puzzles, and a suspenseful atmosphere, it offers a unique gaming experience as you navigate your escape as a test subject.",
